                        <li style="list-style-type: square;"> 20 KWp Roof top on-grid solar power systems at surda administration building has been installed at ICC unit. Approx.19400 KWH of electricity generated and saved approx. ₹1.57 lakhs. 1000 KWp Ground Mounted solar power systems has been installed at ICC unit. Approx.12.11 lakhs unit of electricity generated and saved approx. ₹39.36 lakhs.</li>
